    "short_description": "Are they caterpillars? Are they worms? They\u2019re SNIKS! SNIKS is a puzzle game about colorful snakes hungry for fruits. There\u2019s only one problem: They keep getting in each other\u2018s way while eating. Your task: Untie the Gordian Knot of SNIKS and help them eat all the fruits.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cSNIKS\u2019 cute style and simple colors make it the perfect game to exercise your brain without too much intensity. With characters as slithery and sweet as these, how could you pass it up?\u201d<br>Indie Games Plus<br><br>\u201cSNIKS is a fun, creative, and relaxing puzzle game with a great sense of challenge, despite its simple concept.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 148Apps<br>",
